  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(187.68pt, 102.24pt, "The situation described above with a very variable demand pa")
  #line-at(471.48pt, 102.24pt, "Ĵ")
  #line-at(477.72pt, 102.24pt, "ern creates a chal-")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 115.08pt, "lenging scenario, which requires the employment of advanced pressure management to ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 127.92pt, "assure the right level of service to the customer, while keeping pressure as low as possible ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 140.64pt, "to reduce leakage rates and the appearance of new bursts. Since the demand is much ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 153.48pt, "higher during the summer period, the operator decides to keep a higher value of pressure, ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 166.32pt, "assuring the level of service. On other hand, during the winter, with lower demand, the ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 179.16pt, "pressure is much lower. ")
  #line-at(187.68pt, 192pt, "Noja town supply is fully gravitational from a distribution tank. The length of the ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 204.72pt, "WDN amounts to a total of 48.33 km. The main pipe materials are ductile iron (DI) and ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 217.56pt, "polyethylene (PE), which represent around 90% of the total length. The remaining 10% ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 230.4pt, "consists of asbestos (AB) and polyvinyl chloride (PVC) pipes. Large sizes, from DN150 to ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 243.24pt, "DN300, are made up of metal material. For sizes below DN150, plastic materials are used.  ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(166.44pt, 268.08pt, "2.2. Hydraulic Control Setup Description ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(187.68pt, 283.8pt, "The water supply at Noja is controlled by a DN300 PRV equipped with an electronic ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 296.64pt, "controller which varies pressure at the outlet of the valve, ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(417.72pt, 296.64pt, "P2,")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(431.4pt, 296.64pt, " according to the flow to keep ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 309.48pt, "a fixed pressure at the critical point ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(325.44pt, 309.48pt, "P3")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(336.6pt, 309.48pt, ". It is an open-loop CPC method similar to the one ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 322.32pt, "used in [5], which relies on the flow measurement at the inlet of the WDN. The flow signal ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 335.16pt, "comes from the pulse output of a mechanical water meter installed upstream the PRV. The ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 347.88pt, "electronic controller is installed in parallel and isolated from the original pressure reduc-")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 360.72pt, "ing pilot of the valve to avoid interferences over the control of the valve. The controller is ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 373.56pt, "logging upstream and downstream pressure at 15 min logging interval with a sampling ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 386.4pt, "rate of 10 s. The controller sets pressure at the outlet of the valve according to the pressure ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 399.24pt, "management scheme implemented. The controller works with a dead band of ±0.5 m in-")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 411.96pt, "dustry standard for this type of devices. A datalogger is installed in the critical point log-")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 424.8pt, "ging pressure data with the same logging interval and sampling rate. ")
  #line-at(187.68pt, 437.64pt, "Below, Figure 4 shows the location of the PRV and the critical point in Noja WDN, ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 450.48pt, "including the elevations of each of the sites. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(166.44pt, 744.36pt, "Figure 4. ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 9pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(204.36pt, 744.36pt, "P3")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(214.32pt, 744.36pt, " and PRV location in Noja and the area supplied by the PRV. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(187.68pt, 768.84pt, "The critical point target pressure has been chosen by the operator according to their ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 781.68pt, "knowledge of the system and the area, as per Table 1 below. The operator keeps different ")
