  #line-at(187.68pt, 447.84pt, "The software packages chosen to obtain the model are IBM SPSS 28 and the EVIEWS ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 460.56pt, "12 SV package. The necessity of using both softwares was the statistical demonstration of ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 473.4pt, "the stationarity of the data series being worked with, namely, the Augmented Dickey–")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 486.24pt, "Fuller test, and the use of the model verification tests, AKAIKE and ")
