  #line-at(166.44pt, 511.92pt, "EVIEWS package as the stationarity test, the identification of the orders of the regular and ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 524.64pt, "seasonal part as well as the assessment of the different estimated models using the AIC ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 537.48pt, "and BIC criteria are performed. The IBM SPSS 28 software, with the expert model, is used ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 550.32pt, "to obtain the model coefficients, forecasts and estimators that justify the goodness of fit, ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 563.16pt, "as well as the Ljung–Box test. ")
