  #line-at(187.68pt, 619.56pt, "The available data series covers almost the entire year 2021 with hourly intervals. The ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 632.4pt, "period from April to September was selected to obtain a model which can be used for any ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 645.24pt, "date of the year. This selection also allows enough data available for model validation. ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 658.08pt, "Data from October to December will be used for model validation purposes.")
  #line-at(187.68pt, 670.8pt, "The time series to be modeled is obtained from the quotient between the critical point ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 683.64pt, "pressure (")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(209.64pt, 683.64pt, "P3")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(220.8pt, 683.64pt, ") and the pressure at the outlet of the PRV (")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(405.48pt, 683.64pt, "P2")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(416.64pt, 683.64pt, "), measured every hour, between ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 696.48pt, "0:00 h and 23:00 h on each of the days considered. It involves a total of 4392 datapoints.")
  #line-at(187.68pt, 709.32pt, "Before identifying the model, it is analysed whether the data series is stationary or ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 722.16pt, "not, a condition to be fulfilled to obtain the ARIMA model. The original data series is sub-")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 735pt, "jected to the Augmented Dickey–Fuller test using the EVIEWS program test to confirm the ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 747.72pt, "stationarity or non-stationarity of the data. The result obtained has a ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(470.64pt, 747.72pt, "p")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(475.68pt, 747.72pt, "-value greater than ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 760.56pt, "0.05, specifically 0.0629, which means that the null hypothesis is fulfilled; thus, the series ")
  #line-at(166.44pt, 773.4pt, "is non-stationary and it must be transformed to make it stationary.")
]

